id=hwlevel_p0_override
name=hwlevel P0 Override (ENVSIGERR / No Signal Fix)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=mahdi
description=Overrides ro.boot.hwlevel from MP to P0 at boot, letting the MediaTek modem skip the signed-critical-data check that causes AT+EFUN / +ENVSIGERR failures and "no signal" after an NVRAM/proinfo wipe. See README for details.
